<title>GREECE: GREEK INTERBANK JOINS DIASNET PAYMENTS SYSTEM.</title>
<headline>GREEK INTERBANK JOINS DIASNET PAYMENTS SYSTEM.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek private Interbank said in a statement that it joined DiasNet retail payments system making it possible for its clients to access 1,000 ATMs throughout Greece.</p>
<p>Holders of Interbank Visa and Interamerican Visa will be able to use the ATMs all over Greece to withdraw money and check their account balances, it said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
